<LegalPage title="License" description="A plain-language summary of the Flicksy license." updated="September 4, 2026">
  <p>Flicksy is sold as a paid-upfront Mac App Store app. There is no subscription and no Flicksy account.</p>

  <h2>Purchase and redownloads</h2>
  <p>Your purchase is associated with the Apple Account used to buy Flicksy and can be downloaded again from that account’s Purchased list, subject to Apple’s store terms. Flicksy does not sell or restore an in-app product. Family Sharing is not enabled.</p>

  <h2>Trial download</h2>
  <p>The direct download includes a 14-day trial. When it ends, install the paid Mac App Store version. Switching builds preserves compatible Flicksy app data, but the trial download does not itself become a paid copy.</p>
</LegalPage>
